      "start": "00:00:08.967",
      "text": " No, I'm big. I'm big for my age."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:18.977",
      "start": "00:00:16.975",
      "text": " I told you not to go anywhere without me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:20.979",
      "start": "00:00:18.977",
      "text": " You have to listen to me, Bailey."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:21.980",
      "start": "00:00:20.979",
      "text": " I'm your big brother."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:23.982",
      "start": "00:00:21.980",
      "text": " Come on. Let's go."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:26.985",
      "start": "00:00:23.982",
      "text": " Stop! Bailey, come back!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:28.987",
      "start": "00:00:26.985",
      "text": " Where is everyone?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:33.992",
      "start": "00:00:30.989",
      "text": " My family accidentally left me at a gas station."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:36.995",
      "start": "00:00:33.992",
      "text": " Do you know anywhere I can go to stay and maybe clean off?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:39.998",
      "start": "00:00:36.995",
      "text": " There's a place down the road called Sharpen-Russum."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:40.999",
      "start": "00:00:39.998",
      "text": " You might try there."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:45.963",
      "start": "00:00:43.961",
      "text": " This is a working branch."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:47.965",
      "start": "00:00:45.963",
      "text": " Around here everybody works and pitches in."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:49.967",
      "start": "00:00:47.965",
      "text": " I can do it. Let me show you."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:03.981",
      "start": "00:01:00.978",
      "text": " All you want to do is play around."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:05.983",
      "start": "00:01:03.981",
      "text": " Maybe you just don't belong here."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:15.993",
      "start": "00:01:13.991",
      "text": " I don't think my family loves me."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:17.995",
      "start": "00:01:15.993",
      "text": " Oh, sure they do."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:20.998",
      "start": "00:01:17.995",
      "text": " Then why haven't they come for me?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:30.966",
      "start": "00:01:29.965",
      "text": " Thank you."
    }
  ],
